# Plan: Configurable Page Size for Submission Lists (#3045)

## Approach

Add a per-source page-size preference (12 / 25 / 50 / 100) stored in
`localStorage`, surfaced as a small dropdown in `ShowCandidatesComponent`.
The selected value feeds directly into the existing `this.pageSize` field
that `performSearch()` already reads, so no new search path is needed.
# SAM: Currently the defaults are different for search and list. I want to retain that difference. Vary the options and defaults: 10 (default) / 25 / 50 / 100 for list, 25(default) / 50 / 100 for search. If I'm mistaken about that, let me know.

No backend changes required — `pageSize` is already part of every paged
request (`PagedSearchRequest`). No virtual scroll, no infinite scroll; full-DOM
rendering is acceptable up to 100 rows.

